    {# PTF Export Instructions #}
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-black text-slate-950">Exporting &amp; Submitting PTF Files</h2>
      <ol class="mt-4 list-decimal list-inside space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-700">
        <li>File</li>
        <li>Export</li>
        <li>ProScore Transfer File</li>
        <li>Browse</li>
        <li>Choose Desktop (or any folder), then name the file using the meet naming convention:<br>
          <code class="rounded bg-slate-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs">YYYY-MM-DD CT-GymName Local 4-6&amp;PO</code></li>
        <li>Save</li>
        <li>Export</li>
        <li>Right-click on the file (usually on Desktop)</li>
        <li>Click <strong>Send to &rarr; Compressed (Zipped) Folder</strong></li>
      </ol>
      <div class="mt-6 rounded-lg bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 p-4">
        <p class="text-sm font-bold text-amber-900">Email the zipped folder to:</p>
